# Docker build context — DEFAULT DENY (allowlist).
#
# WARNING: .gitignore is NOT a Docker build-context boundary. Docker never reads
# it. Before this file was an allowlist, every local `.env`, `.secrets/`,
# `.capture/`, `config.local.yaml` and `checkpoints.json` in a developer's tree
# was transferred to the daemon with the context and recorded in the build-stage
# cache, even though the final distroless image copies no source tree. Only
# .dockerignore prevents that. Add every new sensitive path to BOTH files.
#
# The build context is the REPOSITORY ROOT on every path we support, and
# .dockerignore is honoured only at the context root, so this one file governs
# all of them:
#   deploy/docker-compose.yaml          build.context: ..
#   .github/workflows/ci.yml            docker/build-push-action, context: .
#   .github/workflows/publish.yml       -> rknightion/.github container-publish.yml
#   direct/BuildKit                     docker build -f deploy/Dockerfile .
# (.goreleaser.yaml deliberately has no docker pipeline — see its header.)
#
# Adding a top-level path the image build needs? Re-include it below. Forgetting
# fails the build loudly with a missing package/file — never silently.
# Verified by: scripts/check-secret-hygiene.sh docker

# Deny everything, at every depth.
**

# --- re-include exactly what deploy/Dockerfile consumes ---
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/**
!internal/**
!LICENSE
# Copied into the runtime image at /etc/tailscale2otel/config.example.yaml.
!config.example.yaml
# The builder runs scripts/notices.sh to generate THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md into
# /licenses/. It reads its template from its own directory.
!scripts/notices.sh
!scripts/notices.tsv.tmpl

# --- re-deny inside the allowlisted trees (last match wins, so keep these last) ---
# Tests never ship, and their fixtures include captured API payloads.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/**
# Belt and braces: these can never be reached through the allowlist above, but
# keep them explicit so a future `!` re-include cannot resurrect them silently.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.secrets/**
**/.capture/**
**/checkpoints.json
**/checkpoints/**
**/config.local.yaml
**/config.smoke.yaml
**/config.lowlog.yaml
